Carafe: prepare exclusive window geometry before device creation, not after a successful fullscreen Reset.
The reset already establishes the fullscreen client area. Reapplying decorated window dimensions afterward
changes that client area under DXVK and can consume the application's subsequent resize before it handles it.
Keep fullscreen-windowed preparation and failed-reset recreation unchanged. Zlib, as the file it changes.

--- a/ddraw/IDirectDrawX.cpp
+++ b/ddraw/IDirectDrawX.cpp
@@ -3756,7 +3756,7 @@
 	};
 
 	// Prepare window and display size
-	if ((!presParams.Windowed || FullScreenWindowed) && !Config.EnableWindowMode)
+	if (((!presParams.Windowed && !d3d9Device) || FullScreenWindowed) && !Config.EnableWindowMode)
 	{
 		SetWindowFullScreen::FullScreen(hm, hWnd, presParams.BackBufferWidth, presParams.BackBufferHeight);
 	}
